        "description": "Twigishijwe ibitari bike vyerekana ko Gogi ari ihanga ry'Uburusiya nk'uko tubizi uyu musi. Igihe Ezekiyeli yavugishwa ivyo, Uburusiya ntibwari bwabeho arik'Imana yarizi ko rizoza ari ihanga ry'intagondwa , rigwanya Imana , rigwanya ukwizera. Murazi ko iryo hanga mu karanga karyo kuva na kera ryamye rivuga riti nta Mana iriho, bitayeko Abarusiya aho hambere babaye abambere mu banka urunuka Abayuda. Ivyavuzwe kuri Gogi kugeza ubu ntibirashitswa bizoba mu gihe c'iherezo Imana imaze kwegeranya Ab'Isirayeli ibakura mu mahanga yose basabagiriyemwo. Abarusiya nabo ngo bazogeragezwa n'ukuja gutera muri Isirayeli ariko n'Imana izoba ibakwegeyeyo kugira batikirireyo (Ez 38:4) ariko ngo bazoja gutera ntibazohakura agatwe (Ez 38:24).",
